+ *   item-name (itemName) Human-readable name, appended to the accessible label.
+ *   label     (label)    Visible label text. Defaults to "Favorite".
+ *   checked   (checked)  Boolean. Present = favorited.
+ *   disabled  (disabled) Boolean. Present = not interactive.
