+/*
+ * The Daily Grind – client-side SPA router with keep-alive views.
+ *
+ * Each view is built lazily the first time it is visited. When you navigate
+ * away, its DOM is NOT destroyed: it is moved offscreen (content-visibility:
+ * hidden + inert), so form input, filters, cart contents and scroll position
+ * survive, and returning to it is just a class toggle.
+ */
