+| `PASSKEY_DB_PATH` | `.data/passkeys.json` | Location of the passkey store |
+| `PASSKEY_RP_ID` | request hostname | WebAuthn relying party ID (e.g. `chrome.dev`) |
+| `PASSKEY_ORIGINS` | request origin | Comma-separated list of allowed origins |
