+      Serif body text sits alongside inline code such as
+      <code>font-size-adjust: from-font</code> and
+      <code>document.querySelector()</code>. Because the container extracts the
+      x-height ratio from its primary font, the monospace snippets render with
+      the same lowercase height as the surrounding prose instead of looking
+      noticeably smaller or larger.
+    </p>
+  </section>
+
+  <section aria-labelledby="theme-heading">
